#: src/postulo/templates/server/person_delete.html:8
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"%(name)s (<strong>%(username)s</strong>, %(email)s) and everything the account owns: applications, companies, documents and the files behind them, reminders, tokens, connections. The files are removed from the disk. Nothing can bring it back."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s (<strong>%(username)s</strong>, %(email)s) an alles, wat de Kont besëtzt: Kandidaturen, Firmen, Dokumenter an d'Fichieren dohannert, Erënnerungen, Tokens, Verbindungen. D'Fichiere gi vun der Disk ewechgeholl. Näischt kann dat zréckbréngen."

