#: src/postulo/templates/partials/phone_numbers.html:15
#, draft
msgid ""
"A mobile, a desk line, a switchboard — as many as are worth keeping, with one of them marked as the one to use. Documents print that one."
msgstr ""
"En Handy, eng Festnetzlinn, eng Zentral — sou vill der derwäert sinn ze behalen, mat engem markéiert als deem, dat ze benotzen ass. Dokumenter drécken dat."

#: src/postulo/templates/partials/phone_numbers.html:74
#, draft
msgid ""
"A number is kept once on this instance. If one is already recorded here, saving says so rather than taking it from whoever has it."
msgstr ""
"Eng Nummer gëtt op dëser Installatioun eemol behalen. Ass eng scho hei notéiert, seet d'Späichere dat, anstatt se deem ewechzehuelen, deen se huet."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html:414
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"A package registers a source under the <code>%(group)s</code> entry-point group. A plugin that only registers entry points appears as soon as it is installed; one that adds pages of its own needs a restart. A source that fails to load is logged and left out, and the built-in ones keep working."
msgstr ""
"E Package registréiert eng Quell ënner der Aklappunkte-Grupp <code>%(group)s</code>. E Plugin, deen nëmmen Aklappunkte registréiert, erschéngt, soubal en installéiert ass; en, deen eege Säiten dobäisetzt, brauch en Neistart. Eng Quell, déi net lued, gëtt am Journal notéiert an ausgelooss, an déi agebauter schaffe weider."

#: src/postulo/templates/settings/account.html:101
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"A passkey is tied to the address you made it at, which here is %(host)s. Reaching this instance by another name, or moving it, will not carry your passkeys over."
msgstr ""
"En Zougangsschlëssel ass mat der Adress verbonnen, wou Dir en ugeluecht hutt, hei %(host)s. Dës Installatioun ënner engem anere Numm z'erreechen oder se ze plënneren, hëlt Är Zougangsschlëssele net mat."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/email.html:154
#, draft
msgid "A password is stored. It is never shown, not even its length."
msgstr "E Passwuert ass gespäichert. Et gëtt ni gewisen, net emol seng Längt."

#: src/postulo/templates/widgets/suggestions.html:6
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"A plugin has suggested one thing that may have happened: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">look at it</a>."
msgid_plural ""
"Plugins have suggested %(counter)s things that may have happened: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">look at them</a>."
msgstr[0] ""
"E Plugin huet eng Saach virgeschloen, déi eventuell geschitt ass: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">kuckt se un</a>."
msgstr[1] ""
"Plugins hunn %(counter)s Saache virgeschloen, déi eventuell geschitt sinn: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">kuckt se un</a>."

#: src/postulo/templates/applications/suggestion_list.html:122
#, draft
msgid ""
"A plugin that reads a mailbox or a calendar for you files what it finds here, and it stays here until you accept or decline it."
msgstr ""
"E Plugin, deen fir Iech eng Boîte oder e Kalenner liest, leet dat, wat en fënnt, hei of, an et bleift hei, bis Dir et unhuelt oder ofleent."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html:25
#, draft
msgid ""
"A plugin's own file is checked against the checksum its catalogue signed. Its requirements are not: those are fetched from PyPI when it is installed, and are whatever is served that day. Trusting a plugin means trusting its list of requirements too. Postulo installs only built wheels, never a source package that would run its own code while installing, and records everything that arrived."
msgstr ""
"Dem Plugin säin eegene Fichier gëtt géint d'Prüfsumm gepréift, déi säi Katalog ënnerschriwwen huet. Seng Ufuerderungen net: déi ginn beim Installéiere vu PyPI gehol a si dat, wat deen Dag ugebuede gëtt. Engem Plugin ze vertrauen heescht, och senger Ufuerderungslëscht ze vertrauen. Postulo installéiert nëmme gebauten Rieder, ni e Quellpackage, deen beim Installéieren säin eegene Code ausféiere géif, an notéiert alles, wat ukomm ass."

#: src/postulo/resume/registry.py:71
#, draft
msgid ""
